**Locator chaining
const userCard = page.locator('.user-card');
await userCard.getByRole('button', { name: 'Edit' }).click();

**filter()
const johnCard = page.locator('.user-card')
    .filter({ hasText: 'John' });

await johnCard.getByRole('button', { name: 'Edit' }).click();

