**What does waitUntil mean?
When you navigate to a page, Playwright can wait for different browser-loading milestones.
commit	Response received and document begins loading
domcontentloaded	HTML has been parsed
load	Page load event has fired
networkidle	No network connections for at least 500 ms

Assertion	What it verifies
toBeVisible()	Element is visible
toBeHidden()	Element is hidden or absent
toHaveText()	Element has the expected text
toContainText()	Element contains the expected text
toHaveValue()	Input has the expected value
toBeEnabled()	Element is enabled
toBeDisabled()	Element is disabled
toBeChecked()	Checkbox or radio is checked
toHaveURL()	Page URL matches the expectation
toHaveTitle()	Page title matches the expectation


